Subject: [PATCH v2 04/33] ARM: davinci: remove davinci_intc_type
Date:   Fri,  8 Feb 2019 18:34:29 +0100
Message-Id: <20190208173458.4801-5-brgl@bgdev.pl>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.20.1
